# Lucy RP2040 controller board: serial access without dialout membership.
# VID/PID match firmwares/rp2040/src/main.rs; installed by install.py.
#
# MODE="0666" rather than TAG+="uaccess" alone, which grants nothing over SSH or
# in a headless session. Any local user can open the port.
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="16c0", ATTRS{idProduct}=="27dd", MODE="0666", TAG+="uaccess"
